1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,999
The easiest way to resist temptation? Don't look at it.

2
00:00:05,349 --> 00:00:11,070
Your brain reacts to what it sees. See a snack, want a snack. See your phone, grab your phone.

3
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:17,163
So hide it. Put snacks in a high cabinet. Charge your phone in another room.

4
00:00:18,413 --> 00:00:23,498
And do the opposite for good habits. Leave fruit on the counter, and a book on your pillow.

5
00:00:24,748 --> 00:00:27,989
You don't need more willpower. You need fewer reminders.

6
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:32,441
What's one thing you'll hide today? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:34,091 --> 00:00:36,983
Follow me for more delayed gratification tips.

